# What's on August 2015?

This month you can find us for a free jam and lots of fun all over the place. These jams mentioned are not to be missed and if you don't have a drum.. use one of ours! The Buderim Street party is on August 15th. Come and join in the fun, bring a drum or use one of ours! There is going be lots of action and we intend on jammin' it up. This event goes from 6pm-9pm. Also, there will be performances at the Bundaberg Multicultural Festival. Really looking forward to returning to this awesome festival and seeing all of our familiar Bundy friends! Just recently we had a gorgeous couple Maree and Sam purchase some drums off us and we hope to catch these guys and everyone else up there for a visit! Last but not least, we will see you all August 29th at The Lane, Palmwoods for Saturplay. A FREE Drum Jam to celebrate the MOON!
